steps.description:
Create utility function for displaying relative time in attention contexts.

Create packages/planner-ui/src/utils/time.ts:

export function formatRelativeTime(date: string | Date): string
// Returns: '2h ago', '14 days ago', 'just now', etc.
// For stale_draft context: 'stale for 14 days'
// For awaiting_approval: 'submitted 2h ago'

Use Intl.RelativeTimeFormat for i18n support. Handle edge cases: invalid dates return empty string.

Hook to categorize plans into attention sections for PlansListPage.

Create packages/planner-ui/src/hooks/useAttentionPlans.ts:

export function useAttentionPlans(plans: PlanSummary[]): {
  needsAttention: PlanSummary[];
  workingOn: PlanSummary[];
  allOther: PlanSummary[];
  loading: boolean;
}

Categorization rules:
- needsAttention: plans with attention_types that include urgent types (not 'none', not only 'active')
- workingOn: plans with attention_types including 'active'
- allOther: remaining plans (can overlap with workingOn - user might want to see all)

Memoize categorization to prevent unnecessary re-renders.
